### ==========================================
### 角色管理 — Role Management
### 路径前缀：/role
### ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000

### ------------------- 角色分页列表 -------------------
### @name Get Role List (Page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/role/list?name=&pageNo=1&pageSize=10 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 所有角色（不分页）-------------------
### @name Get All Roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/role/all?status=1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 角色详情 -------------------
### @name Get Role Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/role/detail?id=1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 创建角色 -------------------
### @name Create Role
# permissions 字段传入菜单/权限 ID 列表
POST {{baseUrl}}/role/create HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "editor",
  "name": "编辑者",
  "status": "1",
  "remark": "内容编辑角色",
  "permissions": [1, 2, 3]
}

### ------------------- 更新角色 -------------------
### @name Update Role
POST {{baseUrl}}/role/update?id=2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "高级编辑者",
  "status": "1",
  "remark": "内容编辑角色（增强权限）",
  "permissions": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
}

### ------------------- 删除角色 -------------------
### @name Delete Role
POST {{baseUrl}}/role/delete?id=2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 取消分配角色（批量）-------------------
### @name Remove User Roles
# 从指定角色中移除一批用户
POST {{baseUrl}}/role/users/remove?id=1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userIds": [3, 4]
}

### ------------------- 分配角色（批量）-------------------
### @name Assign User Roles
# 将指定角色分配给一批用户（在当前工作空间下）
POST {{baseUrl}}/role/users/add?id=1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userIds": [3, 4]
}
